{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b6c8ab98-21b5-5a55-993a-a75ddac6f60d", "source_ordinal": 1625, "reading_ordinal": 2432, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自由的印花税", "published_at": "2024-04-24T03:27:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/653732373/answer/3476443090"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "关于“如何判断专业选哪个方向”其实没什么很特别好的普适方法——至少没有好到“包不后悔”的方法。因为这不是一个纯粹的“准确预测未来”的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "而是个无意识的“仪式”。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "面临重大选择，人会害怕，然后会用“慎重”这类的方式熬一段时间，直到熬到某种必要的要素耗尽——也许是时间、也许是存款、也许是自己或者某个重要关系人的耐心——尤其是痛苦积累到一定的难以忍受的程度。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "只有付足了这样的痛苦代价，人才会足够相信未来的自己会原谅现在的自己可能犯有的“判断错误”。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只有到这一步，人才会在将来必然到来的某种挫折面前辩解“我当时也是没办法了”——既然是如此重大的会影响后半生的决定，咋可能不在某个时候面临某种不顺利呢？难道人生几十年都一帆风顺这么好运气吗？", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以人们往往下意识的宁可用“留置一年”来换这张免罪卡。有了这张绝望颁发的免罪卡，人才真的敢去领取自己的自由。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "人害怕绝望，以为绝望是自由敌人。然而却恰恰是绝望，在帮人承受自己的自由。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这听上去很疯狂，但这却是一个实情、一个死结。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这不是说不要去做调查研究、比较权衡——这当然是要的——而是说不要过度执着于要做“正确的选择”。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你尽了自己的调查义务，也尽了自己的“煎熬之礼”，就可以往前迈了。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你所能有的最好的选择，并非所谓的“正确的选择”，而是“我能原谅的选择”——the choice you can live with.", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不要反复问“这是不是正确的选择”，而要问这是不是一个“即使错了，我将来也可以原谅自己，但不选将来我可能不能原谅”的选择。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这意味着你除了“盈利预期”这个要素之外，最好还有别的出于道义义务、个人理想、个人原则上的理由。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "何谓“没有办法”？如果仅仅是经济上的“没有办法”，你就要等到自己濒临破产、眼看着三餐不继，才能叫“没有办法”，才会有足够的勇气和动力作出改变。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但如果算上“必须尽到忠诚义务”、“必须言而有信”……等等这些你坚持不放弃的原则，你就可以早点领取那张“绝望证”，早些前往下一站。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 829}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "注意，即使是如此，一定程度的煎熬和痛苦一样是不可避免的。", "char_start": 830, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这个“印花税”自己看淡一点，更容易承受。", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 879}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：工作了一段时间，为了继续深入，要面临专业方向上的选择。该考虑哪些问题，以及如何做出选择？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“自由的印花税”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“关于“如何判断专业选哪个方向”其实没什么很特别好的普适方法——至少没有好到“包不后悔”的方法。因为这不是一个纯粹的“准确预测未来”的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "关于“如何判断专业选哪个方向”其实没什么很特别好的普适方法——至少没有好到“包不后悔”的方法。因为这不是一个纯粹的“准确预测未来”的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 69, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "efc59617-3016-5780-86fc-31d4106a06c0", "source_ordinal": 1624, "reading_ordinal": 2433, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "倦怠", "published_at": "2024-04-25T05:16:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/653772835/answer/3477653544"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "做职业，要真的去关爱你的客户。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "在一切的利益、博弈之外，要对你的客户——不是具体的哪一个客户，而是你的客户群体——有真正的服务精神。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要真的关心ta们的疾苦，ta们的期待。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "要念念不忘，常在心头。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "要盘算着像给恋人准备惊喜一样，不断的盘算着怎么给ta们更大的惊喜。要盘算着怎么让ta们无可挑剔、无可抱怨，因为有你而感到幸运，嘴角带笑。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "要不断的创造新的工具，积淀你的经验资产，改进你的服务。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个努力的深度是无限的，是其乐无穷的。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "举点例子——我何以每天答题不倦，要扩展爱发电，要发展素问……因为我对你们有感情，真正的感情。我每天都在考虑怎么能让你们获得更多的惊喜。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你不付出真感情，你也难有真的激情。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果你中了太多的那种犬儒主义的毒，只是把客户当一群过于麻烦的讨厌鬼，一个不方便的饭碗，你迟早会过于专注自己的“付出”，而去不自觉地怨恨你自己选择的服务对象。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你心里存着这个对客户的暗暗的敌意，你跟客户之间就天然存在着戒惧——你防着ta们、忍着ta们，ta们也要防着你，忍着你。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "防着、忍着，客户就不会给你足够的好的反馈，不会给你你其实极其需要的原谅、鼓励和感激。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你没有这些原谅、鼓励和感激的时时修复，你的怨恨、戒备就会更加发酵，迟早有一天你会倦怠和绝望。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不光是对一个特定的客户倦怠，而是对你所有的客户都倦怠，进而对一切的“服务ta人”都倦怠——甚至是对服务自己的子女、父母、配偶都倦怠，都绝望。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 601}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "那不是“换一个工作”可以解决的。", "char_start": 602, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "要做到建立这种感情，不能躺着等客户、等别人来给你自己各种激励，要靠很多自我的心理建设和引导，要防止一些不必要的猜疑暗自发育、避免使用一切不必要的补弱和过度防御。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这涉及到大量的具体议题，只有这样多达数千、数万个的具体答案可以给你一个勉强可用的参考。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "和人建立和保持好的关系，从根上讲是要先打磨好自己。打磨好自己，这关系建立好了，对方会给你足够维持激情的反馈，你的倦怠才能屡屡被击退——乃至于你会产生一种信心，相信这些倦怠最终总会被击退，无非发作一阵而已。过不多久，自然又有某个你关心的客户陷入危难，激起你的关切和激情，倦怠就消失了。", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "一言以蔽之——击退这种倦怠的根本，是有效的、踏入正循环的爱。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 916}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "一旦踏入正循环，爱会像进入自持状态的核聚变一样，自己产生一切维持自身的能量还有富余。", "char_start": 917, "char_end": 959}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不要去相信那些阴阳怪气、挑拨离间的坏东西，那些东西可以帮你发泄一时的怨恨、不满，却是以磨损你爱的能力和信念为代价，以剥夺你激活这种正循环的能力为代价。", "char_start": 960, "char_end": 1035}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这种正循环关系是你的救生绳，避难所，末世方舟，你真正的出路所在。", "char_start": 1036, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "不要搞错了。", "char_start": 1069, "char_end": 1075}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：工作了好几年，职业倦怠了怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“倦怠”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“做职业，要真的去关爱你的客户。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "做职业，要真的去关爱你的客户。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b223322d-9a73-5ee6-8bc2-327f664b08dd", "source_ordinal": 1623, "reading_ordinal": 2434, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "最先的关系", "published_at": "2024-04-25T05:52:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/653667460/answer/3477659448"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人和自然界的关系才是一切其它关系的基础——包括人和自己的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你是该惩罚自己还是该奖励自己，是该批评自己还是该认可自己，这构成了你和自己的关系的实践。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那么你首先要有一个“根据什么依据来决定是自我奖励还是自我惩罚”的基本问题。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而这个基本问题，绝不能是“看这些决定是否会改善我和张三的关系”——那就意味着你和张三的关系先于你和自己的关系，是后者的基础。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一旦你明白了这个关联性，就立刻会明白两个最基本的道理：", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "1）把和自己的关系放在任何别的关系之前是没有意义的，因为这将无法产生这个最基本的指导性收益。一旦失去了这个价值判断，人和自己的关系本身就会空洞化、茫然化。会出现为了让自己感觉良好而自我奖励这种荒唐而危险的行为。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "2）能放在与自我的关系之前的首先必然是人与自然的关系。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "什么叫人与自然的关系？", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人从自然界取得基本生活所需，就是最基本的人与自然的关系。人挖掘泥土做成陶器、人点燃火堆烹制食物、人从自然采集和猎获食物、人砍伐树木建造房屋，这都是人与自然的关系。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个关系甚至要在人认识到镜子里的就是自己之前就存在，它是先天的在人与自己的关系之前就存在的。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你决定惩罚还是鼓励自己的最基本的可靠准绳，就是这惩罚和激励是否会改善你和自然的关系，是否有助于你猎获更大的猎物、作出更耐用的陶器、作出更保暖的衣物。", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "能达到这个目的，那就该惩罚就惩罚、该激励就激励。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这是可靠的、可以验证的、可以长期打磨和努力的，因为自然对人是始终忠实而稳定的。自然不会莫名其妙的闹脾气，不会听信任何人的挑拨离间。行就行，不行就不行，行就一直行，不行就一直不行。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 670}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因此，以此为基础来指导你自己和自己的关系就是可靠的、稳定的。", "char_start": 671, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而一旦你和自然的关系良好，你自然可以有很大的筹码和余力去处理你和别人的关系。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而你和别人的关系是该修补，还是该疏远，是该抗议还是该道歉，同样应该以你和自然的关系为准绳，而不是你与自己的关系为准。", "char_start": 741, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "具体来说，就是你要不要跟张三道歉，不取决于你自己觉不觉得愤懑或者愧疚，而取决于你向张三道歉是否会导致你猎获、制造、修复的能力——即你和自然的关系——得到改善。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 879}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "人和自然的关系才是人和其它一切的关系——包括和自己关系——的前提。", "char_start": 880, "char_end": 913}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这是个星形结构，而不是一个逐级层叠的结构。", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 935}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：人和自己的关系是否是一切伦理关系的基础？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“最先的关系”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人和自然界的关系才是一切其它关系的基础——包括人和自己的关系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人和自然界的关系才是一切其它关系的基础——包括人和自己的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b8fb7ab5-b9da-5ac7-a791-88429eff93de", "source_ordinal": 1622, "reading_ordinal": 2435, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "乱发脾气", "published_at": "2024-04-26T03:06:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/46386733/answer/3478837572"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "世界上根本没有“乱发脾气的人”这么一种人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所有的人发脾气都有ta自己的原因，哪怕ta本人“说不清”——这绝大多数情况是不想对你说、自认为羞耻不愿对任何人说，部分是真的自己也不能明确的理解——背后一定有其充分的原因。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果没有这种原因，真的就如你所说的是“乱发”、那么仅仅这个“乱发”，就已经是精神错乱、思觉失调的重症，已经需要强制入院治疗。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "换言之，在你用“乱发”来描述对方的行为时，你已经做出了最大的“对付”——即因为不能面对自己理解能力的无能，宁可给对方扣上“疯子”、“精神病人”的“诊断”。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你甚至理解错了你此时此刻的处境——你不是刚遇到了什么对方的一步狠棋陷入一筹莫展需要集思广益想对策，而是你已经无意识的深刻的侮辱了对方，需要穿好防弹衣钻进核掩体等待迎接核还击了。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "还谈什么对付？钻地道保命先吧。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "停止对你自己未能理解的他人的行为妄加“非理性”的罪名，这就是你现在就能做的改变。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "否则单凭你的这个“诊断”，你就可能没有必要再去想什么“对策”了。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人与不承认自己理性的人不共戴天，没有和解可能。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "谁把你当成疯子，就等于否定你的人格，不把你看成一个有正常行为能力的人，换了你，你会怎么处理这种人？你还会给ta什么机会来“安抚我的情绪”吗？", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你难道要当一个“模范精神病人”？", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 540}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这种彻底否决人格的侮辱是你就是想共存都没有余地的，有你无我，有我无你，接下去的剧情里只能留下一个幸存者。", "char_start": 541, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果是同一个公司，就只能留下一个。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果是夫妇，就只有分手一途。", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "只要这个“诊断”不收回、不撤销、不做椎心泣血的忏悔和道歉，这个关系已经没有可以“维护”的未来可言，和平分道扬镳已经是最大的仁慈和宽容。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人说了这种话、表露了这种意思，没有道歉却还活得好好的，已经欠人不杀之恩。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果“乱发脾气”这个话已经说出了口，你最该要做的是去感谢对方的仁慈和宽大，这就是你应该去做的那个“怎么办”。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 786}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "如果没说，那就还有“怎么办”可言。", "char_start": 787, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "怎么办？下面这是标准答案：", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "1）很抱歉，我可能不够聪明，暂时不太清楚什么地方做得不够好，让你不能保持良好的情绪，但我确信这中间肯定有某个可以尝试改进的地方。", "char_start": 819, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "2）如果你愿意的话，我可能需要你的帮助来找到这个地方。", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "3）无论如何，请你相信我没有刻意要伤害你的意思——尽管这样请求可能强人所难，但希望你相信，你现在所看到的应该是我的一种愚蠢，而不是恶意。", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 980}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "4）我能理解你现在可能比较紧张，不能以最好的状态处理现在的问题，所以你可以直接告诉我我可以怎么做，至少缓解现在的情况，或者争取到更好的解决问题的条件。", "char_start": 981, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "5）请你不要过于担心，我相信只要互相帮助，总能找到降低这类问题出现机会的办法。", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1096}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你可以在这基础上自己修改，但修改之前，体会清楚这些话和“你这人怎么乱发脾气”的差别。", "char_start": 1097, "char_end": 1139}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样对付乱发脾气的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“乱发脾气”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“世界上根本没有“乱发脾气的人”这么一种人。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "世界上根本没有“乱发脾气的人”这么一种人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "79a0e5c3-d268-5292-ac4d-30338beb983a", "source_ordinal": 1621, "reading_ordinal": 2436, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有言在先", "published_at": "2024-04-26T04:02:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/654049611/answer/3478845780"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "要养成习惯，开口之前要先预告你要说多少话。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如开口先说“我说三点”，“给我三分钟”，“简要概括我要说的结论就是xxx，现在我解释一下原因，一共四条”……", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "并且在开口之前把你要讲的几条数清楚、想通顺，把准备说的话的水分挤掉。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "必要的话你可以记一点小笔记，比如几个关键词。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但一开口，就要先立约、再积极守约。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一般而言，只有主事者、大会主席、主持人享有不限时的主动发言权，除此之外的人要说话，一定要让其他人事先预知这个发言会什么时候结束。否则很快听众的耐心就会耗尽，一旦耗尽，无论你实际上是否啰嗦，听众都会不耐烦。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "有约定在先，并且你的表述的确显示出你在简洁上下了功夫，那么即使你仍然不够简洁，你的礼数也已经到位了，你的努力已经被证实了，宽容你的表现就成了聆听者的社会义务，任何人再要扣什么“太啰嗦”的罪名，就要犯众怒。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为这是不允许人有局限性，属于残暴和刻薄，自居有苛求人的权利。这会自动刺激其他人拿更苛刻的标准去衡量苛刻者，导致苛刻足额飞速的丧失社会资本。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 430}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：每当对某件事进行讨论的时候，别人总会趋向于说我想的太多，该如何处理？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“有言在先”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“要养成习惯，开口之前要先预告你要说多少话。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "要养成习惯，开口之前要先预告你要说多少话。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "61b71b90-4310-528f-82d4-aa837d4ef71d", "source_ordinal": 1620, "reading_ordinal": 2437, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "zz理论", "published_at": "2024-04-26T19:31:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/653779947/answer/3479724010"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这问题其实有一个现成的答案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那就是图书管理员自己就是在1920年（时年27岁）的时候读的gcd宣言和资本论。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "他显然是一个成功的例证，所以“三十岁之前不能读（zz）理论名著”至少是不成立的。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "问题是你怎么读，怎么管理这些阅读对你的影响。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这总的来说有这么几条：", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "1）政治是关系到国计民生的重大事务，你必须清楚它的客观逻辑——它的话语权一向并不由“最有理论水平”的人掌握，而是由众所信服的最关切民间疾苦的人来掌握。智囊、专家只是作为这种“民望所归”的幕僚、参谋存在，而不是直接做出判断、承担责任的人。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是自古以来的常态，也是将来也不会改变的恒态。生杀予夺的大权只能操之于爱人和仁人之手，而绝不能简单的交给“智者”，否则苍生必有大难。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因此，世界上从来就不存在“我理论水平高所以我应该当老大”这样的逻辑，这样的错觉仅仅存在于按成绩论地位的基础教育阶段。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "有无数的人——尤其是学生——阅读zz理论名著的实质理由是想要借助这种理论包装获得更大的zz话语权，以为这就是个辩论赛的“锦标”，只要怼赢了，大王就是我，当不上大王少说也混个顶戴，这完全是南辕北辙，缘木求鱼。", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "人本来对你这些行为无可无不可，但一旦发现你这行为背后的动机是这个，只会一面觉得可笑一面觉得可鄙。可笑在于这根本就没明白规则到底是啥，可鄙在于虽然不知道规则是啥，却是奔着犯规来干的。这就像有个傻瓜以为扎小人能杀人，于是拿着写着你名字的小人扎扎扎一样，逮着了你肯定不会因为这很好笑就觉得这不该打。", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）你要知道zz理论本身是很不够的，是皮毛而已。你要真的想要说话有人认真听，有人严肃的对待，那么你就毫无侥幸的明白——你必须有大量的实践经验。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这要么是靠时间积累的阅历——四十岁，五十岁的人说话就比二十来岁的人说话有人听。尤其是现在本科教育基本普及，二十岁出头近乎毫无社会经验，说话毫无实践经验作为基底，只有理论包装下的情绪发泄，根本没有实际的重量。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你等不急二三十年的社会历练，那么你就要用大规模的社会调查、田野调查，或者干一干“上门销售”、调查记者这类的极为深入基层的亲民工作来填这个空。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 874}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "无论如何，没有走南闯北、见多识广的阅历做基础，只有建立在书斋理论推算——甚至仅仅是模拟游戏体验——基础上的“政治理论水平”是没有意义的。", "char_start": 875, "char_end": 943}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人家不认，你没什么可惊讶的。", "char_start": 944, "char_end": 958}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这是绝对必要的作业，如果你真的想要严肃的追求这方面的实践，这一条没有任何商量可言。", "char_start": 959, "char_end": 1000}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你必须要有真诚的愿望和能力把贩夫走卒、下里巴人当成与你一样的、甚至是可爱的人——不是需要你“拯救”的“可怜人”，不是比你低等的“社会底层”，而是你的兄弟、姐妹、未曾谋面的血肉同胞。", "char_start": 1001, "char_end": 1091}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你如果没有这种感觉，没有这个感情，你就注定不可能严肃的参与任何政治实践——顶多只是当一下执行类的普通公务员，不能担当政策制定、主持局面的政务官。", "char_start": 1092, "char_end": 1164}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你就不要勉强自己，这也没什么丢人的——当个工程师、科学家、艺术家、商人……没啥不好。", "char_start": 1165, "char_end": 1207}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "尤其是你还省下了大量的无谓消耗，对你追求更有回报的目标还有更大的好处。", "char_start": 1208, "char_end": 1243}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "3）如果你已经确信自己没有“人缘”——即与人民群众普遍而亲密的羁绊——而且也无志于此，那么你就不要再想要以游戏的、娱乐的态度对待zz议题。", "char_start": 1244, "char_end": 1313}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这就像你不能把“横渡大西洋”、“盖座长江大桥”当游戏玩，因为大西洋、长江毫无幽默感，它们不会跟你开玩笑，该淹死你、赔死你时，它们是眼睛都不会眨的。", "char_start": 1314, "char_end": 1387}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "对待这些问题，你只有严肃认真一种合理的态度。", "char_start": 1388, "char_end": 1410}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "只是严肃认真不止有“严肃认真的去当船长”，也可以严肃认真的当水手、当乘客。", "char_start": 1411, "char_end": 1448}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "阅读这些zz理论著作，就像了解海洋法、航海技术、船舶原理，这固然对当船长、当大副是必修课，对于你自己获得最好的乘船体验也不无好处。", "char_start": 1449, "char_end": 1514}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你更容易理解暴风雨来时作为乘客你该作何选择，更容易预料出现机械故障时船舶会去停靠什么港口，更容易明白为什么这船不会走直线，而是要停靠若干个港口“绕远路”。", "char_start": 1515, "char_end": 1592}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不明白这些，时间久了你都会没心情上甲板晒太阳，一天到晚恐慌想象船要沉了全体船员都在骗你，搞出半夜三更抱着根木头在太平洋中间跳船“求生”的悲剧。", "char_start": 1593, "char_end": 1664}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "能不能读，当然可以读，问题在于你要读来干什么，准备怎么读。", "char_start": 1665, "char_end": 1694}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：三十岁之前可以读类似毛选和马克思之类的书籍吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“zz理论”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这问题其实有一个现成的答案。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这问题其实有一个现成的答案。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6ff9a877-2a69-5c0f-bb18-71a977b32455", "source_ordinal": 1619, "reading_ordinal": 2438, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不成人形", "published_at": "2024-04-27T03:54:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/323848626/answer/3480020673"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你这是多余的担心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为只要你在担心这个，“海王”就会觉得你有毒，自然而然的就会“放过”你。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "别说什么“撩你”，连沾你的边都不会有任何兴趣。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "听到、察觉到一个女生在担忧“xx是不是海王”还去招惹的，不可能有命活到加冕典礼。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为这种事遇到这种人是很容易出人命的，甚至很容易一尸两命，多大的势力、多少钱都不能保证摆平。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果连这点基本的常识、基本的敬畏都没有，只会落得吴亦凡那种下场。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "任何人，哪怕是骗子、小偷、强盗，只要有可持续性，都会有一些可持续性所要求的基本原则，这跟ta们的个人素质无关，而是来自自然法的强制要求。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“海王”是过了可持续性检验的，所以“不招惹不能为自己负责于是需要别人代ta负责的人”是个绝对的禁忌。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你可能觉得自己天生丽质、家财万贯，但这些东西对随时随地有很多选择的“海王”们来说根本不稀缺。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以你没有必要去担心这种“风险”。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "因为你的担心本身就会去掉这个风险。", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你要在意的反而是那些心智不成熟的胆大妄为之辈，类似吴亦凡这种自认为能搞定一切的“漂亮朋友”。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而这些小鬼只是些还没修成人形的野狐禅而已。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 463}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人形都不成，遑论称王？", "char_start": 464, "char_end": 475}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么看出一个男生是不是海王？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“不成人形”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你这是多余的担心。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你这是多余的担心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1f2df416-d8f5-5ec2-b75a-0dbee48bec4d", "source_ordinal": 1618, "reading_ordinal": 2439, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自给的爱", "published_at": "2024-04-27T17:35:18+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/653588766/answer/2022946694640215298"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实亲密关系这个事和“经济自给”并没有绝对联系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "经济独立并不是开启、保持亲密关系的绝对必要资格门槛。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "否则“无论贫穷富有”有何意义呢？", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "亲密关系本来就有供养特性，并不必须是“两个盈利主体的合作经营”。如果说它经济上有门槛，那么门槛仅仅只是作为一个整体在经济上有可持续性，而并不需要双方都能做到“经济独立”。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "说点最基本的——父母和子女也是亲密关系，难道子女全得要出门捡瓶盖糊纸盒子凑自己的学费？", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人有很多愿意以“经济”为代价去满足的需求，并不一定非要靠“不断的赚到现金”来维持一种关系的延续。而亲密关系所能满足的需求里面当然有钱买不到的部分。", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "双方自愿，各负其责，这就足够了，不必过于执着“经济独立”。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "经济独立不是亲密关系的要求，而是人自己对自己的一种要求，虽然也很重要，但这不能算在亲密关系头上。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "具体来说，另一半可以说“我一个人支撑不了我们的生活水平了，你可不可以承担一部分”，这是可以的。但是如果对方说“你能不能自己养活自己？一个自己都养活不了自己的人怎么能跟人交往？”，那么你通过实现经济自给来证明ta的判断错误的必要性本身就已经消失了。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为ta在否定亲密关系的供养特性、支援特性，将“无论贫穷还是疾病”这些内容从亲密关系中剥离。而“只能共富贵，不能共患难”的所谓“亲密关系”本身就是虚无的。对方一作这样的要求，就意味着对方的爱的定义里不包括救援和供养的内容，意味着这种爱有“不吃亏”的要求。", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这样的爱本身基本没有价值，自然也不值得为了挽救去付出大量的证明成本。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 638}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "亲密关系不受到经济压力的挑战固然意味着容易稳固，但这不等于亲密关系不该承担经济挑战的必要义务。", "char_start": 639, "char_end": 686}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "若是一开始就宣布“咳嗽的都抛落船”，客人为什么一开始要上船？", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 717}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但是注意——这不表示追求经济自给不重要。", "char_start": 719, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "仅仅作为一个亲密关系的参与者，你是不需要经济独立的，但是作为一个人，经济自给对你有很大的意义。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 787}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0358"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：在尚未经济独立的年纪，如何面对爱情（亲密关系）？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“自给的爱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实亲密关系这个事和“经济自给”并没有绝对联系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实亲密关系这个事和“经济自给”并没有绝对联系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 24, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
